                    {
                        "form_id": "021d9299-7952-4f7d-b8f4-d428e156034c",
                        "entry_id": "29f37831-ce9d-3a08-a20e-ab6fee4f6b96",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "беспра́виях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "347afe83-ee3a-3401-a5ff-635ecc701eba",
                        "entry_id": "29f37831-ce9d-3a08-a20e-ab6fee4f6b96",
                        "glosses": [
                            "отсутствие гражданских, социально-экономических и политических прав"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "467d631e-31ba-4be9-8210-c294db21c403",
                                "sense_id": "347afe83-ee3a-3401-a5ff-635ecc701eba",
                                "text": "Идеалисты, которые ехали в Россию по зову сердца, увидели бесправие, террор, проституцию, нищету и покидали первое пролетарское государство разуверившимися в идеях социализма."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "25608229-0d92-4cc0-b0fd-121d8f9fe9f8",
                                "sense_id": "347afe83-ee3a-3401-a5ff-635ecc701eba",
                                "text": "Нас возмущали догматизм, бесхозяйственность, бюрократизм, бесправие людей, зверства сталинизма, тупоумие чиновничества, но не система сама по себе. 〈…〉 Вечными язвами России были и остаются нищета и бесправие, бесправие и нищета. Нищета — из-за отсутствия священной и неприкосновенной частной собственности, бесправие — из-за гипертрофированной запредельной значимости государства в жизни общества. 〈…〉 Нищета и бесправие — две стороны одной и той же медали. 〈…〉 Нищета и бесправие всегда ищут виновников на стороне."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc4d3f20-914b-4ac8-8a6d-ee8cd030d6a4",
                                "sense_id": "347afe83-ee3a-3401-a5ff-635ecc701eba",
                                "text": "«Бесправие разлито по всем глубинам страны, а мы только за одно держимся: чтоб не лишили нас безуёмного пьянства»."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6c92d6fe-fe79-3536-9b47-0880b2712c35",
                        "entry_id": "29f37831-ce9d-3a08-a20e-ab6fee4f6b96",
                        "glosses": [
                            "отсутствие законности; произвол"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac743677-3b9c-40d4-9085-d1e21f4c4435",
                                "sense_id": "6c92d6fe-fe79-3536-9b47-0880b2712c35",
                                "text": "Оттого, что воспитание у нас варварское, оттого, что depuis de l’enfance, так сказать, с матерним молоком мы всасываем в себя произвол, оттого, что у нас в ходу ручная расправа, оттого, что бесправие…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "98b5d3cb-619e-4979-bae1-8b31d4c3af98",
                                "sense_id": "6c92d6fe-fe79-3536-9b47-0880b2712c35",
                                "text": "Возрастало недовольство не Россией, к которой кавказцы всегда стремились, а властью, в частности, военной администрацией Кнорнича, чиновники которой занимались взяточничеством, казнокрадством, насаждая не порядок, а бесправие на Кавказе."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "977155d7-4e4b-4bc9-8101-7be36160da90",
                        "source_entry_id": "29f37831-ce9d-3a08-a20e-ab6fee4f6b96",
                        "source_sense_description": "отсутствие прав",
                        "target_lang_word": "absence de droits",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dceebfe9-77dd-40cc-9d20-7f655fb9aa51",
                        "source_entry_id": "29f37831-ce9d-3a08-a20e-ab6fee4f6b96",
                        "source_sense_description": "отсутствие законности; произвол",
                        "target_lang_word": "lawlessness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lawlessness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a50679a-26e5-3904-8b14-e145b40be2a8",
                                        "entry_id": "db4fa502-7916-3860-ba13-59af6c486157",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lack of law; a lack of law and order; anarchy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff906b81-dbf4-46ea-b0d5-1a472aa75b2d",
                                                "sense_id": "9a50679a-26e5-3904-8b14-e145b40be2a8",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: Wild West, free-for-all"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d1da9c5-effa-378c-8aa6-bf129192a739",
                                        "entry_id": "db4fa502-7916-3860-ba13-59af6c486157",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Defiance of the law; outlawry, exorbitant levels of crime."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e8ec11c-f4a4-4040-9bcc-a13d2c07b51f",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1da9c5-effa-378c-8aa6-bf129192a739",
                                                "text": "Houseless and Homeless. The estimate of the New York Housing Conference Secretary, Mr. Edward P. Doyle, that it will take half a billion dollars to overcome the present housing shortage, is probably not an exaggerated presentation of the plight New York is in in this respect. Furthermore, the housing-shortage conditions of New York reflect, proportionately, the conditions prevalent in almost every large city in the country. We seem to be threatened with widespread houselessness and homelessness, for the pitiable makeshifts to which so many are driven by house shortage, and the consequent exorbitant rents, are appalling travesties of what American homes should be. Just what Mr. Walter Stabler, Comptroller of the Metropolitan Life Insurance Company, meant when he said that \"unless radical action is taken something drastic will happen,\" is not quite clear. \"Something drastic\" is a pretty vague term. Mr. Stabler could hardly mean riotous invasions of the premises of the \"ins\" by infuriated mobs of the \"outs.\" Houselessness is undoubtedly a breeder of lawlessness, but it is not open to direct-action remedies of the bread riot variety which sheer hunger not infrequently precipitates. If people have not a place to lay their heads at night, not because they are penniless but because there are no roofs to shelter them, about the only thing they can do is to camp in parks and suburban fields. It has even come to that in Newark, and it may come to that elsewhere unless there is relief of some sort."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2321fda-96b4-44d3-9d31-8353a7b783cd",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1da9c5-effa-378c-8aa6-bf129192a739",
                                                "text": "The Waterfront Commission of New York Harbor, created in the 1950s to break the mob’s grip on the docks, became its own bastion of corruption and lawlessnesses, according to a scathing report from the released on Tuesday after a nearly two-year investigation by the state inspector general’s office."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce6156b6-f524-4f93-9aef-018b1c2973fa",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1da9c5-effa-378c-8aa6-bf129192a739",
                                                "text": "We’re in decline because a spirit of lawlessness, shamelessness and brainlessness has become a leading feature of a conservative movement that was supposed to be a bulwark against all three."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d2ca5430-12ee-478e-b4bb-5013563ec725",
                        "source_entry_id": "29f37831-ce9d-3a08-a20e-ab6fee4f6b96",
                        "source_sense_description": "отсутствие законности; произвол",
                        "target_lang_word": "illegality",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "illegality",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d0d3f4d-9da9-301e-a8a3-4312e5abd30b",
                                        "entry_id": "f147c1e2-f322-391b-8aa6-a51a820244fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "the state of being illegal"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbe6fa48-6ba4-476c-a8c1-28a64dd1d4bd",
                                                "sense_id": "2d0d3f4d-9da9-301e-a8a3-4312e5abd30b",
                                                "text": "The criminal was aware of the illegality of his act."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90ef6e3d-ad21-494e-8e14-87a4cb9341a9",
                                                "sense_id": "2d0d3f4d-9da9-301e-a8a3-4312e5abd30b",
                                                "text": "In Fraenkel’s defiance of mortality and professionalism and his skill in navigating the triple state lay part of the origins of his idea of the dual state. He answered the illegality in the Nazi prerogative state with his own commitment to illegality in both the resistance and even the legal system itself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e94a272-62a0-3c02-be60-e38ace86e2a7",
                                        "entry_id": "f147c1e2-f322-391b-8aa6-a51a820244fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "a defense to the validity of a contract because it was in violation of the law"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9927725e-bc4a-4f33-98bb-95b51e20d7e7",
                                                "sense_id": "0e94a272-62a0-3c02-be60-e38ace86e2a7",
                                                "text": "When sued for refusing to pay for services provided by a prostitute, the customer raised the defense of illegality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cbd32a04-909a-43a4-8de3-6340b409524e",
                        "source_entry_id": "29f37831-ce9d-3a08-a20e-ab6fee4f6b96",
                        "source_sense_description": "отсутствие законности; произвол",
                        "target_lang_word": "d'illégalité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd011351-1d87-4627-b70a-567f9dd92fdd",
                        "source_entry_id": "29f37831-ce9d-3a08-a20e-ab6fee4f6b96",
                        "source_sense_description": "отсутствие законности; произвол",
                        "target_lang_word": "arbitraire",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "arbitraire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cfbca606-b0fc-310f-b80f-9ad96445a66d",
                                        "entry_id": "3347f31e-efba-3334-bf26-43e3a41689cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est produit par la seule volonté de l’homme, sans avoir de règle ni de fondement naturel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4e4c089-b28a-4f55-81eb-ee8bd718aeba",
                                                "sense_id": "cfbca606-b0fc-310f-b80f-9ad96445a66d",
                                                "text": "Or, ce qui manque à l’éclectisme, c’est justement une base scientifique et positive; et ses prétendus dogmes ne sont pas moins arbitraires et cérébrins que les dogmes des églises."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f380043-80b1-4943-954f-10b6e768b2ba",
                                                "sense_id": "cfbca606-b0fc-310f-b80f-9ad96445a66d",
                                                "text": "Il se souvint tout à coup d’une vieille chronique où il avait, pour flétrir, stigmatiser, juvénaliser les comportements bourgeois, […] projeté le feu rouge des catachrèses les plus imprévues, des synecdoches les plus arbitraires, des antonomases les plus follement tirées par les cheveux, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "637d7ec8-e800-4ed6-93d3-80c622ceebf1",
                                                "sense_id": "cfbca606-b0fc-310f-b80f-9ad96445a66d",
                                                "text": "La distinction que l’on fait entre un astéroïde et une planète est purement arbitraire puisque fondée uniquement sur la dimension."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b87fd07a-2afe-38d7-bf07-550506597e1f",
                                        "entry_id": "3347f31e-efba-3334-bf26-43e3a41689cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui dépend du choix de chaque personne ou de chaque administration, sans en référer à quiconque."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4dc0109-d823-42a4-a790-32c9632a48ed",
                                                "sense_id": "b87fd07a-2afe-38d7-bf07-550506597e1f",
                                                "text": "L’Assemblée n’a point décidé là-dessus, cela est arbitraire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73736674-0cf0-48d4-b06e-0e44069c9b2e",
                                                "sense_id": "b87fd07a-2afe-38d7-bf07-550506597e1f",
                                                "text": "La décision est arbitraire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a2c5927-a502-3c6a-82a0-8e8eed98a39c",
                                        "entry_id": "3347f31e-efba-3334-bf26-43e3a41689cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est laissé à la décision du juge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53444565-06a8-414f-8fb8-c86892eb38b6",
                                                "sense_id": "6a2c5927-a502-3c6a-82a0-8e8eed98a39c",
                                                "text": "Amende arbitraire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "157921bf-39d2-3156-bb3f-04663cb711ef",
                                        "entry_id": "3347f31e-efba-3334-bf26-43e3a41689cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui n’a d’autre règle que la volonté, le caprice d’un maître."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "097bac59-b31b-41fe-a84a-d13d67e2bafc",
                                                "sense_id": "157921bf-39d2-3156-bb3f-04663cb711ef",
                                                "text": "Dans bien des cas, la coutume régionale et la pratique traditionnelle préislamique, combiné à la volonté arbitraire du potentat régnant, sont devenues la base légale du gouvernement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "arbitraire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32e01059-880e-3b13-849d-9147645e185d",
                                        "entry_id": "908f00a7-cbd3-32f4-b6e6-1803c5d3ef24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Principe de ce qui est dénué de légalité ou de légitimité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43ff848d-9a49-4c8f-ad01-2f8566fe774b",
                                                "sense_id": "32e01059-880e-3b13-849d-9147645e185d",
                                                "text": "De l’Inquisition à la justice politique de la royauté et de celle-ci aux tribunaux révolutionnaires, il y avait eu constamment progrès dans le sens de l’arbitraire des règles, de l’extension de la force et de l’amplification de l’autorité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccf8f959-3dec-4b5f-b7ad-48d40747bb41",
                                                "sense_id": "32e01059-880e-3b13-849d-9147645e185d",
                                                "text": "Sous l’Ancien Régime, l’équité souffrit des accusations jetées sur les Parlements dont la jurisprudence, immotivée et secrète, servit souvent les ambitions politiques des gens de robe. Cet arbitraire judiciaire était dissimulé derrière une équité de façade, l’« équité cérébrine », qui inspira une vive méfiance au roi et au peuple, comme en témoigne le brocard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8cb662c-deec-3c5d-8eab-eaafb4a311e4",
                                        "entry_id": "908f00a7-cbd3-32f4-b6e6-1803c5d3ef24",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Acte de gouvernement où la volonté des personnes remplace celle de la loi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e766e25e-ddd4-4cc3-8153-81fd8beda587",
                                                "sense_id": "d8cb662c-deec-3c5d-8eab-eaafb4a311e4",
                                                "text": "Enfin, c’est celui qui veut remplacer la loi tutélaire de la majorité par l’arbitraire tyrannique du petit nombre, faire le peuple esclave du parti & écraser la démocratie tout entière sous une despotique kakistocratie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b22b7a1-182e-41cd-a8f0-f1cfe6573f55",
                                                "sense_id": "d8cb662c-deec-3c5d-8eab-eaafb4a311e4",
                                                "text": "[…]; la mendicité est soumise, en Belgique, à un arbitraire adminis­tratif que l’on peut comparer à celui de la police des mœurs; on sait que cette police, malgré d’innombrables réclamations, continue à être presque souveraine en France."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc809046-fcf9-4239-aff3-481bf94cb2bf",
                                                "sense_id": "d8cb662c-deec-3c5d-8eab-eaafb4a311e4",
                                                "text": "Je franchis une première étape dans cette voie, […], en prenant par décrets un ensemble de mesures (conseils de discipline, codes de l’avancement, etc.) conçu de façon à garantir les fonctionnaires contre l’arbitraire sous quelque forme qu’il pût se manifester."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
